{"id":"ccfc784390e30237","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-top2-component.md","title":"ZFC Top2 Component","display":"df-zfc-top2-component — ZFC Top2 Component","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-top2-component","aliases":["58-df-zfc-top2-component"],"display":"df-zfc-top2-component — ZFC Top2 Component","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-topological-space]]","[[58-df-zfc-top2-connected-space]]","[[58-df-zfc-top2-subspace-topology]]","[[58-df-zfc-set-indexed-union]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-top2-component"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-top2-component</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-top2-component — ZFC Top2 Component"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"58-df-topological-space\">58-df-topological-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c347796153b0ec02\" href=\"?note=c347796153b0ec02\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top2-connected-space\">58-df-zfc-top2-connected-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"694a41b0cb75249b\" href=\"?note=694a41b0cb75249b\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top2-subspace-topology\">58-df-zfc-top2-subspace-topology</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3a78929818a246ba\" href=\"?note=3a78929818a246ba\" title=\"58-df-zfc-set-indexed-union\">58-df-zfc-set-indexed-union</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in V\">\\(X\\in V\\)</span> (topological carrier)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span> (topology)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in X\">\\(x\\in X\\)</span> (base point)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\subseteq X\">\\(C\\subseteq X\\)</span> (component of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq X\">\\(A\\subseteq X\\)</span> (connected subset bound in the union)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in V\">\\(\\sigma\\in V\\)</span> (subspace topology witness)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ConnectedSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ConnectedSpace}_S\\)</span> (connected-space predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c347796153b0ec02\" href=\"?note=c347796153b0ec02\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top2-connected-space\">58-df-zfc-top2-connected-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2SubspaceTopology}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2SubspaceTopology}_S\\)</span> (subspace-topology predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"694a41b0cb75249b\" href=\"?note=694a41b0cb75249b\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top2-subspace-topology\">58-df-zfc-top2-subspace-topology</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span> (topological-space predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2Component}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2Component}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top2\\text{-}component} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop2Component}_S(C,x,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land x\\in X\\land C=\\bigcup\\{A\\in\\mathcal P(X):x\\in A\\land\\exists\\sigma\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2SubspaceTopology}_S(\\sigma,A,X,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ConnectedSpace}_S(A,\\sigma))\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top2\\text{-}component} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop2Component}_S(C,x,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land x\\in X\\land C=\\bigcup\\{A\\in\\mathcal P(X):x\\in A\\land\\exists\\sigma\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2SubspaceTopology}_S(\\sigma,A,X,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ConnectedSpace}_S(A,\\sigma))\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The component is a bounded union of connected subspaces containing <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>.  Its topology is obtained through the registered four-place subspace-topology predicate rather than reconstructed by an unsourced inline term.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-topological-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top2-connected-space","status":"resolved","id":"c347796153b0ec02","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top2-connected-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top2-subspace-topology","status":"resolved","id":"694a41b0cb75249b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top2-subspace-topology]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-set-indexed-union","status":"resolved","id":"3a78929818a246ba","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-set-indexed-union]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top2-connected-space","status":"resolved","id":"c347796153b0ec02","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ConnectedSpace}_S$ (connected-space predicate; see [[58-df-zfc-top2-connected-space]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top2-subspace-topology","status":"resolved","id":"694a41b0cb75249b","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop2SubspaceTopology}_S$ (subspace-topology predicate; see [[58-df-zfc-top2-subspace-topology]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in X","display":false},{"tex":"C\\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ConnectedSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2SubspaceTopology}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2Component}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top2\\text{-}component} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop2Component}_S(C,x,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land x\\in X\\land C=\\bigcup\\{A\\in\\mathcal P(X):x\\in A\\land\\exists\\sigma\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2SubspaceTopology}_S(\\sigma,A,X,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ConnectedSpace}_S(A,\\sigma))\\}","display":true},{"tex":"x","display":false}],"bytes":1594,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3533","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-top2-component.md|58-df-zfc-top2-component]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing